// The core's clusters (GDR-0026: the precursor archive, the best tech, rising radiation; GDR-0130, decided by Niklas
// 20 Oct 2026, details lead defaults): the precursor defences' patrols and sentry posts, fragments of a megastructure,
// and at the galaxy's centre the Archive (the band's `centre`). Radiation everywhere in them (`radiation`): every part
// takes heat through each side open to space, as beside a hot star (GDR-0102) but the same all over the cluster, more
// the nearer the cluster lies to the galaxy's centre. PLACEHOLDER NUMBERS (lead defaults; radiation and counts tuned
// with the headless voyage runner and the heat test, docs/results/core-band-2026-10-20.md).
[
    (
        id: "sentry_reach",
        name: "Sentry reach",
        summary: "Bright, radiant space on the way to the centre, patrolled by precursor sentries and held by their stations.",
        description: "The radiation heats every part open to space: bring [[part:radiator|radiators]] and [[part:heat_sink|heat sinks]].",
        radius: (2000, 2800),
        spacing: (700, 1400),
        words: ["Reach", "Glare", "Ward"],
        sites: [
